<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <svg width={1280} height={720} viewBox='0 0 1280 720' style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, opacity: 0.18 }}>
        <rect x='800' y='200' width='440' height='80' rx='40' fill='none' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='3' />
        <rect x='800' y='330' width='130' height='70' rx='8' fill='none' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='3' />
        <rect x='955' y='330' width='130' height='70' rx='8' fill='none' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='3' />
        <rect x='1110' y='330' width='130' height='70' rx='8' fill='none' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='3' />
        <path d='M800 370 H 1240' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='4' />
        <path d='M1235 362 L 1252 372 L 1235 382' fill='#8FC0F0' />
        <rect x='800' y='470' width='440' height='80' rx='40' fill='none' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='3' />
        <text x='1020' y='252' fill='#8FC0F0' font-size='30' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>x</text>
        <text x='1020' y='522' fill='#8FC0F0' font-size='30' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>F(x) + x</text>
    </svg>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', paddingTop: 84, paddingLeft: 72, paddingRight: 72, paddingBottom: 72, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 40 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 200, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9', lineHeight: 1 }}>
                03
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 150, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.35)' }} />
            <Box style={{ gap: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 50, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 3 }}>
                    ResNet：深度残差网络
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', fontSize: 21, color: '#8FC0F0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                    Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#CFE0F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    一条跳跃连接，让上百层的网络第一次变得"能训练"。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26, gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>网络退化问题</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DCE8F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    层数加深后训练误差反而上升，这不是过拟合，而是优化本身失败了。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26, gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>残差学习</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DCE8F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    H(x) = F(x) + x，让每层只学"增量"，学不动时自动退化为恒等映射。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26, gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>家族与迁移</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DCE8F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    18 / 34 / 50 / 101 四种深度，配合 ImageNet 预训练迁移到医学小数据。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
